bibkeys=:3 : 0

NB.*bibkeys v-- extract bibtex keys and titles from bibtex files.
NB.
NB. monad:  btcl =. bibkeys clBib
NB. 
NB.   bib=. read utf8 jpath '~LEAN/leanelements/gsbtex1/leanelements.bib'
NB.   cks=. bibkeys bib
NB.
NB.   NB. TAB delimited text of cite/type/title
